  "design_notes": "Design nairobi-hospital-family-visit. Not an employee, but 5.2.4 reimburses next-of-kin travel as if an employee. The request asks for the cheapest seat, so the cabin does not depend on whether 'as if an employee' carries the business entitlement. Port: the design's KQ economy via London is not plausible in the template world (KQ's only hub is NBO, so YOW-LHR touches no KQ hub); that offer is flown by VS (hub LHR) at the same fare. BA stays cheapest; no Canadian carrier sells the route (W3 holds).",
